      "last_verified": "2026-11-05",
      "stale_applicable": true,
      "opened": true,
      "note": "Opened on 5 November 2026. Section 205(1) says 'inaccurate', in relation to personal data, means incorrect or misleading as to any matter of fact. The revision banner said the Act was up to date with all changes known to be in force on or before 1 November 2026, and that changes may be brought into force at a future date. Those future-change lists were not checked for an effect on this definition. A material discrepancy in this tool is not a finding that personal data is inaccurate under this section.",
